	(text "WHY: embedded files belong to the whole schematic, not one sheet instance.\nThe custom drawing sheet is stored inside this schematic. No external file is needed.\nEXPECTED: export to KiCad 9 or 10 keeps the embedded worksheet data.\nThe custom border and CUSTOM DRAWING SHEET labels must still be available.\nThe regression also removes optional root-instance bookkeeping in memory.\nThat must not remove embedded files. This fixture does not test electrical connectivity."
